{
  // Boss roster. One row per boss; the H key (BossSpawnButton) stamps `bossId` at its spawn point
  // and biome / quest spawns will call the same BossSpawner. `health` is the first form's pool.
  // hasSecondForm / secondFormHealth: when the first pool hits 0 the boss refills to the second
  // form's health instead of dying, and its screen-top bar switches from red to secondFormBarColor.
  // healthBarRangeMeters: a player within this distance of the boss gets the bar at the top of their
